        "section": [
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><h3>Annotation</h3><table class=\"hl7__eu__lab__report\"><tr><th>Conclusion and Recommendations based on this report and previous findings known to us</th></tr><tr><td>The patient shows a mildly decreased CD3+CD4+ (T4 helper) cell count, which may indicate some degree of immunosuppression or immune system compromise. Clinical correlation is recommended to assess for possible causes such as recent infections, medications, or underlying immune disorders. Further monitoring or additional immunological workup may be warranted based on the clinical context.</td></tr></table></div>"
